# Saved-building alerts. Installed at /etc/cron.d/rentmap-saved (scp this
# file; never hand-edit on the box — see deploy/cron-rentmap-growth).
#
# 08:20 America/New_York, daily (06:20 until 2026-10-06, moved after the
# 8 AM alert digest so the digest holds the day's one email): saved_alerts.sh diffs every saved building
# against yesterday's snapshot (advertised, voucher listing, price drop,
# lottery or re-rental at the address, HPD violations, DHCR registration) and
# mails each watcher ONE email. Tuesdays it is the weekly round-up instead.
#
# Why 06:20: after the overnight feeds (voucher scrape 04:15 UTC, HCR full
# pass 04:35 UTC, Zumper 03:30 UTC, HPD weekly 08:10 UTC Sunday = 04:10 ET),
# after the 05:00 ET growth run (whose account-lifecycle emails should win the
# day's one slot for brand-new accounts), and before the 06:45 ET re-rental
# sweep so the two never collide on the checkout.
#
# Replaces the 05:00 UTC notify_saved_listings.py cron on 167.71.170.219,
# which is now commented out there.
SHELL=/bin/bash
PATH=/usr/local/sbin:/usr/local/bin:/usr/sbin:/usr/bin:/sbin:/bin
CRON_TZ=America/New_York
# 8:20, after the 8 AM alert digest takes the day's one email (2026-10-06).
20 8 * * * root /root/Find-A-Crib/saved_alerts.sh >> /var/log/rentmap-saved.log 2>&1
